  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「はあ、はあ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「ううう～っ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-bloomer",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bloomer_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "（ほんとに、すぐ後ろから圧迫感がする！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "（追いあげてきてるひとたちの吐きだす息が、背中に当たってる感じ！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "（いつも、追い抜かれてきた！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "（ううん道を譲ってた、わたしなんかが道の真ん中で『もたもた』してたら邪魔だもん！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-bloomer",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bloomer_expression/expressionless",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "（でも今日だけは、逃げない！　強くなるって決めたから！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "（勝負してるんだから、なるべく良い順位でみんなに『たすき』を届けるよ！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-bloomer",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bloomer_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "（……あれ？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "（後ろから響いてた足音が、いきなり消えた？　何でだろう？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-bloomer",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bloomer_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "（わたしの脚力じゃ、どれだけがんばっても後続のひとたちを引き離すなんて無理だし。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "（差が広がった、わけじゃないと思うけど）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-bloomer",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bloomer_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "（それとも、気づかないうちに追い抜かされちゃった？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "（いや、そんな感じもしない。いくらわたしでも、走ってる最中に意識がなくなっちゃうわけもないし。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "（追い抜かれたなら、気づくはずだけど）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "（あれ？　足音の代わりに、何か物騒な音が聞こえてるような？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "（わ、わたしの後ろで何が起きてるの～っ？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "（ちょ、ちょっと振り向いてみようかな。時間と体力をロスしちゃうけど、一瞬だけ！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "（えぇっと……？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-china",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-china_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「八朔ちゃ～ん♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「見て見て、ワタシの大活躍！　アチョー！　ホアチャー！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-bloomer",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bloomer_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「うわっ、龍泉寺さん！　何してるの……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-china",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-china_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「ウフフ！　聞いて驚け見て笑え！　驚き桃の木、山椒の木アルよ～っ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-bloomer",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bloomer_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「龍泉寺さんは、何でそんな日本特有の古風な言い回しを知ってるのっ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-china",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-china_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「ワタシと八朔ちゃんの間に、言葉など不要！　親友だもんねっ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-bloomer",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bloomer_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「いや、できたら何してるのか説明してほしいかなっ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-china",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-china_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「いつも、ワタシは八朔ちゃんに戦う勇気をもらってきた！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「ずっと、その恩を返したいと思ってたアル！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-china",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-china_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「今日がその日ってことね～っ、拳法家は義理堅いアルよ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「ううん、これぞ友情パワー！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「ワタシがこの国で学んだ美徳アルっ、情けは人のためならず……！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「ワタシと、いつも仲良くしてくれたお礼アルっ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-china",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-china_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「ほんとは、八朔ちゃんをお姫さま抱っこでもして運んであげようかなって思ったんだけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「それはたぶん、八朔ちゃんの本意じゃないアルね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「自分のちからで、最後まで走りぬきたいんでしょう？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-china",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-china_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「その気持ちを、尊重する！　八朔ちゃんが、いつもワタシにそうしてくれたように！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「せめて邪魔はしない、ワタシの誇りと友情にかけて！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-bloomer",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bloomer_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「龍泉寺さん……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-china",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-china_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「だけど手助けはしたいから、折衷案として後続の連中をバッタバッタと薙ぎ倒してるアル～♪　」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「こいつらはワタシが足止めするっ、ここは任せて先に行け～！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「アチョー！　ここを通りたくば、ワタシの屍を越えていくアルよ～っ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-bloomer",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bloomer_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「えええ……？　ほんとだっ、後ろを走ってたひとたちがゴロゴロ転がってる！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「倒しちゃったの？　ふつうに失格になるよ、龍泉寺さん！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-china",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-china_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「八朔ちゃんのためなら、ワタシはそれで本望アルよ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-bloomer",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bloomer_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「困る……！　わたしのために、そんなっ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-china",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-china_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「いいから、こっちは気にせず早く行くアル！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「うちの空手部の連中には失格になったら謝るアル、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「あいつら拳と拳でわかりあうタイプだからきっと理解を示してくれるアル！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「事情を説明したら、むしろ誉めてくれるかも？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-china",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-china_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「そういうふうに仲間を信じられるようになったのも、八朔ちゃんのおかげアルよ～！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-china",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-china_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「だから、早く行け！　そう長くは時間を稼げない……！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-bloomer",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bloomer_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「いや、何ていうか……う～ん？　相変わらず、どこかズレてるなぁ龍泉寺さんは？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-bloomer",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bloomer_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "（でも、その気持ちは嬉しい。ありがとう、龍泉寺さん）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "（おんぶに抱っこじゃない、背中を押されて走ってる！　みんなに支えられてる！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-bloomer",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bloomer_expression/expressionless",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "（そう思えるよ、だからわたしは最後まで走りきる！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "（みんなのために！　これから先も、一歩ずつでも！）"
  },
  {
